{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロウィンもひとつあったー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/10/31/7123399/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生写真。魔女さんになりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せくしー期待してるってゆったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばってせくしーしてみました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へいせくしー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/10/31/7123399/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へいせくしー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃーみなさんおこおこしないでー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みるって打ったら\n見る・観るに続きて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( ゜д゜ ) って出てきた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なに見たの？なにを見たのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7thシングル「バレッタ」"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/10/31/7123399/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/10/31/7123399/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/10/31/7123399/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/10/31/7123399/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生写真とかもたくさん持ってたりしたら...\n嬉しい\nそれか...その人と距離置いちゃうってことはない\nキョリ置いちゃうってことはないです！\n嬉しいよーありがとーう∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/10/31/7123399/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん党首のビーム党って\n今党員何人くらいいるのー？笑\n正式には３人かなあ\nそういやブログのコメントとかで\nちょいちょい党員になりたいーって\n言ってくださってるのみるけど\nえ入る？入りたいかしらー？\nビーム党の前にひとまず\nひめきゅんさんに仲間入りしてはどうかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/10/31/7123399/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーから\nバカリボンバカリボンといじられて、\n正直どんな気持ち？\n愛に溢れたニックネームだなーと思って\n嬉しい気持ちですよ(´；ω；｀)\nバカだなんてかわいくないニュアンスも\n愛だなあと(´；ω；｀)ね\n別に悲しくなんか(´；ω；｀)ナイテナイヨー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/10/31/7123399/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんビームって壁とか貫通するの？？\nいやー無理でしょうねー無理ですよー\nだって壁って。壁ですもん壁。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/10/31/7123399/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"センターまであと３ヶ月、、、\nひめたんからの応援欲しいです。\n最近 受験生さん応援してーて方\nたくさんいらっしゃる気がします\nそんな時期かしら。\nえーっと、とりあえず体調に気をつけて\n無理はしないでくださいね♪\n応援してます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/10/31/7123399/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着ぐるみのレパートリー教えてえな？！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/10/31/7123399/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはうさぎさんの他に\nどんな着ぐるみを持っているんですか？\n◎ケアベアちゃん\n◎かぼちゃたん\n◎マイメロちゃん\n◎もこもこうさぎさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/10/31/7123399/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この中に高校生がひとりだけいます\nさあ誰でしょう(´ω`)わかる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/10/31/7123399/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすかりん＊ひめたん＊みりりん＊純奈たん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)"}],"source":"archive"}